WEBVTT

1
00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:51.541
In these verses, Arjun,

2
00:00:51.541 --> 00:00:54.208
who has so far been deeply moved by

3
00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:56.541
the revelations of the Bhagavad Gita,

4
00:00:56.541 --> 00:00:58.375
clearly acknowledges Lord Krishna

5
00:00:58.375 --> 00:00:59.916
as the Supreme

6
00:00:59.916 --> 00:01:03.208
Personality of Godhead.

7
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:05.000
He not only accepts

8
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.375
Lord Krishna's supremacy,

9
00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:10.791
but strengthens his acceptance

10
00:01:10.791 --> 00:01:13.916
by citing the testimony of authentic rishis

11
00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:18.291
such as Narada, Vyasa, Asita, and Devala.

12
00:01:18.291 --> 00:01:20.083
These verses reflect

13
00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:21.875
Arjun's firm conviction

14
00:01:21.875 --> 00:01:23.166
and serve as proof of

15
00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:26.875
Lord Krishna's divinity.

16
00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:33.000
Arjun begins by calling

17
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.500
Lord Krishna 'Param Brahma',

18
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.958
beginning his statement.

19
00:01:36.958 --> 00:01:38.291
He shows

20
00:01:38.291 --> 00:01:39.958
that He is not merely a manifestation

21
00:01:39.958 --> 00:01:42.083
of spiritual energy,

22
00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:45.625
but Himself the supreme spiritual truth.

23
00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:47.000
While some philosophies

24
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.125
emphasise the formless aspect of Brahman,

25
00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:52.166
Arjun makes clear

26
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:53.416
that Lord Krishna is the personal

27
00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:58.375
and supreme form of that truth.

28
00:01:58.375 --> 00:01:59.541
This statement

29
00:01:59.541 --> 00:02:01.916
removes the misconception

30
00:02:01.916 --> 00:02:04.791
that Lord Krishna is an ordinary person

31
00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:08.291
or one among many avatars.

32
00:02:08.291 --> 00:02:12.625
He is the original source and
sustainer of all existence.

33
00:02:12.625 --> 00:02:14.916
By calling Lord Krishna 'Param Dhama',

34
00:02:14.916 --> 00:02:16.666
Arjun acknowledges

35
00:02:16.666 --> 00:02:18.791
that He is the ultimate

36
00:02:18.791 --> 00:02:21.375
shelter and goal for all beings.

37
00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:24.583
This is not limited to material meaning alone,

38
00:02:24.583 --> 00:02:28.541
but indicates that all spiritual

39
00:02:28.541 --> 00:02:32.666
aspirations find their fulfilment in Him.

40
00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:34.583
Lord Krishna is described

41
00:02:34.583 --> 00:02:37.541
as 'pavitram paramam',

42
00:02:37.541 --> 00:02:40.000
the most pure of all that is pure,

43
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.041
meaning He is untouched

44
00:02:43.041 --> 00:02:46.500
by material impurity or imperfection.

45
00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:49.916
This purity does not just reside in Him,

46
00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:52.583
but also purifies all those

47
00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:56.083
who come to His shelter with devotion.

48
00:02:56.083 --> 00:02:56.750
Arjun

49
00:02:56.750 --> 00:03:00.250
describes Lord Krishna as
'purusham shaashvatam divyam',

50
00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.250
meaning

51
00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:05.416
the eternal, divine Person.

52
00:03:05.416 --> 00:03:08.166
Unlike ordinary beings who pass through

53
00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:10.958
the cycle of birth and death,

54
00:03:10.958 --> 00:03:14.041
Lord Krishna is unborn – ajam –

55
00:03:14.041 --> 00:03:17.458
eternal, and beyond the three material qualities.

56
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:18.958
He is 'vibhum',

57
00:03:18.958 --> 00:03:22.250
all-pervading and all-powerful,

58
00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:27.125
greater than all beings, including
devas such as Brahma and Shiva.

59
00:03:27.125 --> 00:03:29.916
This statement establishes
Lord Krishna's position

60
00:03:29.916 --> 00:03:34.375
as the supreme origin of all creation.

61
00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:35.583
Arjun's words

62
00:03:35.583 --> 00:03:38.750
are not just personal praise of Lord Krishna.

63
00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:42.083
He also validates his understanding

64
00:03:42.083 --> 00:03:44.291
by citing great rishis like

65
00:03:44.291 --> 00:03:47.583
Narada, Vyasa, Asita, and Devala.

66
00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:50.375
These rishis, known for their spiritual realisation

67
00:03:50.375 --> 00:03:53.250
and impartiality,

68
00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.500
through scriptural authority

69
00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.416
and personal realisation, confirm

70
00:03:57.416 --> 00:04:01.875
Lord Krishna's divine position.

71
00:04:01.875 --> 00:04:04.500
Arjun emphasises that Lord Krishna

72
00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.750
Himself has also declared these truths,

73
00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:11.791
making this knowledge beyond dispute.

74
00:04:11.791 --> 00:04:12.833
Arjun,

75
00:04:12.833 --> 00:04:16.166
by deeply accepting Lord Krishna's greatness,

76
00:04:16.166 --> 00:04:19.291
displays a beautiful balance

77
00:04:19.291 --> 00:04:20.583
of scriptural authority

78
00:04:20.583 --> 00:04:22.833
and personal experience.

79
00:04:22.833 --> 00:04:25.666
His statement serves as a great ideal

80
00:04:25.666 --> 00:04:29.000
for any seeker

81
00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.416
who wishes to understand the supreme truth.

82
00:04:32.416 --> 00:04:33.625
It shows

83
00:04:33.625 --> 00:04:34.583
that true knowledge

84
00:04:34.583 --> 00:04:37.708
comes not just from intellectual understanding,

85
00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:39.625
but from experiencing and accepting

86
00:04:39.625 --> 00:04:41.458
the divine spiritual reality

87
00:04:41.458 --> 00:04:43.500
presented

88
00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:46.583
by authentic sources.

89
00:04:46.583 --> 00:04:49.250
Arjun's declaration paves
the way for Lord Krishna

90
00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.666
to reveal His divine glories further

91
00:04:51.666 --> 00:04:54.625
and to deepen Arjun's understanding

92
00:04:54.625 --> 00:04:57.625
even more.

93
00:05:02.125 --> 00:05:04.375
Think about this –

94
00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:06.625
in your heart,

95
00:05:06.625 --> 00:05:08.666
which truth

96
00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:12.291
remains always unshakeable?

97
00:05:12.291 --> 00:05:15.208
In the rush of life,

98
00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:18.875
do you ever pause and ask

99
00:05:18.875 --> 00:05:22.875
what is the foundation of your faith?

100
00:05:22.875 --> 00:05:26.291
Faith in life, when its foundation rests

101
00:05:26.291 --> 00:05:30.208
on reason and deep understanding,

102
00:05:30.208 --> 00:05:36.791
only then does it become truly strong.

103
00:05:36.791 --> 00:05:38.500
Blind faith

104
00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.958
may seem simple at first.

105
00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:45.041
Doesn't it?

106
00:05:45.041 --> 00:05:48.333
But in difficult circumstances,

107
00:05:48.333 --> 00:05:53.250
it cannot hold you up.

108
00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.833
See –

109
00:05:54.833 --> 00:05:58.666
the path Arjun chose,

110
00:05:58.666 --> 00:06:01.083
how beautiful it is.

111
00:06:01.083 --> 00:06:06.458
He accepted My divinity,

112
00:06:06.458 --> 00:06:11.375
but in doing so, he used

113
00:06:11.375 --> 00:06:15.375
both his heart and his intellect.

114
00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:20.125
He did not believe only on the basis of emotion.

115
00:06:20.125 --> 00:06:24.083
He reflected on My words,

116
00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:27.125
learned from his own experiences,

117
00:06:27.125 --> 00:06:30.291
and also drew on the knowledge

118
00:06:30.291 --> 00:06:31.750
and experience of rishis

119
00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:34.458
like Narada and Vyasa.

120
00:06:34.458 --> 00:06:37.333
You too can do this.

121
00:06:37.333 --> 00:06:39.458
When you bring faith

122
00:06:39.458 --> 00:06:42.833
and reason into harmony,

123
00:06:42.833 --> 00:06:46.708
your conviction becomes unshakeable,

124
00:06:46.708 --> 00:06:51.833
no matter how many doubts life may bring.

125
00:06:51.833 --> 00:06:54.541
In your spiritual journey,

126
00:06:54.541 --> 00:06:57.791
remain ever curious.

127
00:06:57.791 --> 00:07:01.041
Ask questions, explore, examine,

128
00:07:01.041 --> 00:07:04.250
just as a child looks at a new toy

129
00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:07.500
from every angle.

130
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.375
True spiritual knowledge

131
00:07:10.375 --> 00:07:14.250
does not come without foundation.

132
00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.916
It comes through observation, experience,

133
00:07:16.916 --> 00:07:21.541
and the agreement of those

134
00:07:21.541 --> 00:07:23.125
who walked

135
00:07:23.125 --> 00:07:26.666
this path before you.

136
00:07:26.666 --> 00:07:29.458
When your faith rests on reason

137
00:07:29.458 --> 00:07:32.666
and experience,

138
00:07:32.666 --> 00:07:35.791
you are empowered,

139
00:07:35.791 --> 00:07:39.083
and with full confidence

140
00:07:39.083 --> 00:07:42.791
you walk the path of truth.

141
00:07:47.083 --> 00:07:49.083
What would it be like

142
00:07:49.083 --> 00:07:52.833
if, when serving dishes onto your plate,

143
00:07:52.833 --> 00:07:57.333
all the dishes were mixed together?

144
00:07:57.333 --> 00:07:59.166
Would you be able to experience

145
00:07:59.166 --> 00:08:02.958
the taste of each dish? You would not.

146
00:08:02.958 --> 00:08:05.000
In the same way –

147
00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.000
when we

148
00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.541
gather spiritual knowledge without order,

149
00:08:09.541 --> 00:08:12.583
without understanding.

150
00:08:12.583 --> 00:08:16.041
In your family, you will see

151
00:08:16.041 --> 00:08:19.041
that many kinds of spiritual ideas

152
00:08:19.041 --> 00:08:23.125
often keep arriving from here and there.

153
00:08:23.125 --> 00:08:25.083
From conversations at home,

154
00:08:25.083 --> 00:08:28.666
from communication media
like phones and television,

155
00:08:28.666 --> 00:08:32.750
or from articles read somewhere.

156
00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:35.125
And true spiritual knowledge

157
00:08:35.125 --> 00:08:38.750
is far more

158
00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:41.791
than the knowledge gained
from these scattered pieces.

159
00:08:41.791 --> 00:08:43.625
Think of it this way –

160
00:08:43.625 --> 00:08:48.958
you are building a beautiful picture puzzle,

161
00:08:48.958 --> 00:08:51.416
but you have no idea

162
00:08:51.416 --> 00:08:55.375
what the complete picture looks like.

163
00:08:55.375 --> 00:08:57.208
How difficult it would be,

164
00:08:57.208 --> 00:08:58.875
to put together.

165
00:08:58.875 --> 00:09:01.166
Arjun has presented

166
00:09:01.166 --> 00:09:04.166
such a beautiful example.

167
00:09:04.166 --> 00:09:08.666
He did not just hear My teachings.

168
00:09:08.666 --> 00:09:13.208
He absorbed them deeply.

169
00:09:13.208 --> 00:09:16.791
He did not build on half-truths,

170
00:09:16.791 --> 00:09:18.916
but enriched his understanding

171
00:09:18.916 --> 00:09:22.916
with the wisdom of great rishis
like Narada and Vyasa.

172
00:09:22.916 --> 00:09:27.083
He enriched his understanding.

173
00:09:27.083 --> 00:09:27.750
In this way,

174
00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:31.250
the knowledge Arjun received was clear,

175
00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.083
free of doubt,

176
00:09:34.083 --> 00:09:37.958
and true for all time.

177
00:09:37.958 --> 00:09:41.791
When all in the family share their information

178
00:09:41.791 --> 00:09:45.833
and knowledge with one another,

179
00:09:45.833 --> 00:09:46.791
together

180
00:09:46.791 --> 00:09:50.541
a clear picture of the truth forms.

181
00:09:50.541 --> 00:09:54.125
Do not be proud of your own knowledge,

182
00:09:54.125 --> 00:09:57.958
but with wisdom and reason,

183
00:09:57.958 --> 00:10:01.583
with each other's help,

184
00:10:01.583 --> 00:10:05.083
enrich your own understanding.

185
00:10:05.083 --> 00:10:08.791
Doing this, in the family together

186
00:10:08.791 --> 00:10:12.208
a strong shared perspective will develop.

187
00:10:12.208 --> 00:10:14.708
Sit together with your family.

188
00:10:14.708 --> 00:10:16.708
Share stories.

189
00:10:16.708 --> 00:10:19.375
Study together.

190
00:10:19.375 --> 00:10:23.125
See how, among you, joy

191
00:10:23.125 --> 00:10:26.583
and the flow of unity grows.

192
00:10:26.583 --> 00:10:28.166
It may be that

193
00:10:28.166 --> 00:10:31.833
in your home there are many viewpoints.

194
00:10:31.833 --> 00:10:35.125
Someone takes a modern approach,

195
00:10:35.125 --> 00:10:38.708
someone a traditional one.

196
00:10:38.708 --> 00:10:41.125
Do not worry.

197
00:10:41.125 --> 00:10:46.166
When all connect to an authentic source,

198
00:10:46.166 --> 00:10:48.041
see how

199
00:10:48.041 --> 00:10:52.208
new positive ideas are born.

200
00:10:52.208 --> 00:10:54.666
A meal plate too has many

201
00:10:54.666 --> 00:11:00.000
kinds of dishes – sweet, spicy, and sour.

202
00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.000
Together they make

203
00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:06.291
a complete and nourishing meal.

204
00:11:06.291 --> 00:11:10.041
The harmony of all perspectives gives birth

205
00:11:10.041 --> 00:11:13.166
to a new, progressive understanding.

206
00:11:17.541 --> 00:11:19.916
Have you ever thought

207
00:11:19.916 --> 00:11:23.250
about a decision you made alone

208
00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:26.583
and one you made after consulting

209
00:11:26.583 --> 00:11:29.708
experienced people?

210
00:11:29.708 --> 00:11:31.791
How much difference was
there between the two?

211
00:11:31.791 --> 00:11:34.916
At the workplace, making decisions

212
00:11:34.916 --> 00:11:36.750
entirely on your own

213
00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.875
carries the risk

214
00:11:38.875 --> 00:11:40.666
of going wrong.

215
00:11:40.666 --> 00:11:43.333
However confident you may be,

216
00:11:43.333 --> 00:11:47.291
it is always better to validate your decision

217
00:11:47.291 --> 00:11:49.625
with experts

218
00:11:49.625 --> 00:11:53.458
and experienced colleagues.

219
00:11:53.458 --> 00:11:57.875
Arjun expressed this understanding beautifully.

220
00:11:57.875 --> 00:12:00.833
Although he had

221
00:12:00.833 --> 00:12:03.583
his own realisation of My divinity,

222
00:12:03.583 --> 00:12:07.833
he still validated his understanding

223
00:12:07.833 --> 00:12:10.541
with the words of these wise rishis.

224
00:12:10.541 --> 00:12:14.000
This is proof of both his humility

225
00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.583
and his wisdom.

226
00:12:16.583 --> 00:12:19.125
You too in your professional field

227
00:12:19.125 --> 00:12:20.875
can do the same.

228
00:12:20.875 --> 00:12:24.666
It does not diminish your ability.

229
00:12:24.666 --> 00:12:28.416
It refines it further.

230
00:12:28.416 --> 00:12:30.416
Whether it is a project,

231
00:12:30.416 --> 00:12:34.250
a new idea, or a problem,

232
00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:36.583
speak to those with experience.

233
00:12:36.583 --> 00:12:38.625
Observe good methods,

234
00:12:38.625 --> 00:12:42.416
and finally add your own talent.

235
00:12:42.416 --> 00:12:43.416
See how

236
00:12:43.416 --> 00:12:44.750
your work

237
00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:48.166
reaches new heights of excellence.

238
00:12:48.166 --> 00:12:50.625
Walk the path of Arjun.

239
00:12:50.625 --> 00:12:53.875
Honour your own insight,

240
00:12:53.875 --> 00:12:58.791
yet also draw light from the knowledge of others.

241
00:12:58.791 --> 00:13:02.458
From this union, you will make decisions

242
00:13:02.458 --> 00:13:05.416
that are not only skilful, but also

243
00:13:05.416 --> 00:13:09.375
far-sighted and inspiring.
